# WP.org SVN listing assets (banner/icon/screenshots) live here, NOT in
# /assets — that directory is the plugin's own runtime CSS/JS and ships in
# the release zip. Keep marketing images out of it entirely so they can
# never accidentally get packaged into the plugin.
/.wordpress-org
